  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="HH3753C2D0F64441EEC1CB77241E2239DC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="HH2FB9527C1D4BB25D79F1C0C76F5BC95D" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock id="HHDB4E63D65FD21AE5462A8FBA840EA717" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInArticlesOfIncorporationOrAmendmentsToCharterTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; line-height:116%; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission dismissed the requests for rehearing and clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes and provided guidance regarding the treatment of accumulated deferred income taxes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;in light of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt; its revised policy. Inquiry Regarding the Commission's Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs, Order on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its July 18 Order, Maritimes &amp;amp; Northeast Pipeline, L.L.C., a tax pass-through entity owned in part &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;at that time &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;by Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission's Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. Maritimes &amp;amp; Northeast Pipeline, L.L.C. has requested approval from the Chief Accountant of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon receipt of the Chief Accountant's approval, Maritimes &amp;amp;Northeast &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;Pipeline,L.L.C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos"&gt; will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission's regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="HHE60759687E403C6B3DE58B8464A791E0" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #242424; font-family: 'Aptos Narrow', Calibri, 'sans-serif', 'Mongolian Baiti', 'Microsoft Yi Baiti', 'Javanese Text', 'Yu Gothic'; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;"&gt;Maritimes continues to operate under its settlement rates under Docket No. RP24-780 that went into effect January 1, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Uses the officers of its Managing Member, M&amp;amp;N Management Company, LLC and has a Management Committee.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Removal, effective 06/01/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Berry, David L., Controller&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Removal, effective 06/05/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;O&amp;#8217;Malley, Grace D., Assistant Corporate Secretary&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Removal, effective 06/22/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Neyland, Stephen J., Vice President - Finance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Appointments, effective 06/01/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Johnson, Ryan M., Controller&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Berry, David L., Vice President&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Appointment, effective 06/05/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;O&amp;#8217;Connor, Katherine M., Assistant Corporate Secretary&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Appointment, effective 06/22/2026&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;Khan, Zeyd A., Vice President - Finance&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ewa-rteLine"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; line-height:116%; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-weight:bold; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-weight:bold"&gt;For the Six Months Ended June 30, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; line-height:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-size:12pt"&gt;These interim financial statements should be read in conjunction with the financial statements and notes thereto contained in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-size:12pt"&gt;the Form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-size:12pt"&gt; 2 of Maritimes &amp;amp; Northeast Pipeline, L.L.C. (M&amp;amp;N, L.L.C.), for the year ended December 31, 2025. These financial statements are unaudited, but in management&amp;#x2019;s opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-size:12pt"&gt;results as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; font-size:12pt"&gt; presented for this interim period are not necessarily indicative of results to be achieved for the full year. Certain information and notes which would substantially duplicate the disclosures contained in the most recent FERC Form 2 have been omitted.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:8pt; line-height:116%; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:Aptos; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
