            <tr>
              <td style="width: 49.9377%;">CWIP&#160; accruals</td>
              <td style="width: 49.9377%;">$&#160; &#160; &#160; (394,204)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH46CF591DAA0294D9D843AFF5DC9E555B" xlink:to="HH3E997819A24D6E19F1CF8F526615D1BA" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHD412CBC652C031E394CB2CAE78C37A28" xlink:label="HHD412CBC652C031E394CB2CAE78C37A28" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH3FF4A28040B7847EEAABD69CFF260266" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Docket No. AI93-5-001 issued on April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHD412CBC652C031E394CB2CAE78C37A28" xlink:to="HH3FF4A28040B7847EEAABD69CFF260266" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHEB6457D586EA035794020255C9C2B735" xlink:label="HHEB6457D586EA035794020255C9C2B735" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHDAF7ACD3101CE9D2B2BD872D7E0C0CCE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Per FERC Docket (CP96-178-000), represents costs incurred on a portion of the M&amp;N Phase I facilities which were placed into service on March 10, 1999. This regulatory asset arises from the deferral of operating costs incurred on the 83 miles of Phase I joint facilities with Portland Natural Gas Transmission System (PNGTS). The FERC allowed M&amp;N to defer the costs beginning from 12/1/99. The asset is being amortized at a rate of 2.2% over the life of the facilities.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHEB6457D586EA035794020255C9C2B735" xlink:to="HHDAF7ACD3101CE9D2B2BD872D7E0C0CCE" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH8D7EBB60556A1B70D084B76B563DA121" xlink:label="HH8D7EBB60556A1B70D084B76B563DA121" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH6F2E5A1A80C43D694C0A3D80DBC30079" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Balance relates to a regulatory asset created as a result of the difference between GAAP and FERC depreciation (Levelized depreciation) created in the years that the FERC rate was less than straight-line rate (prior to 2003). Per FERC Docket (RP02-134-000): The commission approved, by order dated 4/14/1999, M&amp;N's proposal to use the modified depreciation expense approach to achieve a levelized cost-of-serviceover the first four years of service on M&amp;N's facilities. The depreciation rate change relates to main pipeline except laterals, intangibles and general plant. In that order, the Commission directed that M&amp;N record the regulatory asset created by the difference in the depreciation expense between the modified depreciation rate and the straight-line book depreciation rate in account 182.3. Accordingly, the March 12, 2003 Order in Docket No. RP02-134-000 approves the un-amortized regulatory asset remaining after this levelization period shall continue to be depreciated.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH8D7EBB60556A1B70D084B76B563DA121" xlink:to="HH6F2E5A1A80C43D694C0A3D80DBC30079" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHF6C891816D9546BDCFAC51FA0525778C" xlink:label="HHF6C891816D9546BDCFAC51FA0525778C" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC51AE5CF60DFC7F46DC304FDF956E803" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Recorded pursuant to 18 CFR 154.402(a) and 18 CFR 382.202.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHF6C891816D9546BDCFAC51FA0525778C" xlink:to="HHC51AE5CF60DFC7F46DC304FDF956E803" order="1" />
